{"id":"p2ydbsiigsxuskbbi0834ivna","title":"咖啡的科学密码：从茜草科植物到中药","originalTitle":"提神咖啡竟是中药？一杯解锁科学密码","summary":"咖啡不仅是饮品，还被《中华本草》收录为中药，具有提神醒脑、利尿消肿、健胃消食的功效。研究显示，咖啡含有咖啡碱、可可豆碱和茶碱等生物活性成分，能兴奋中枢神经系统，但过量使用可能导致不良反应。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=437607&do=blog&id=1560532"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-10T02:34:22.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-10T10:31:32.099Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-10T10:31:32.099Z","category":"life-science","tags":["论文发表","研究成果"],"score":26,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"b0e776f3-7037-4e01-ad8a-e094888e1681","title":"咖啡树起源与药用价值研究获新证据"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"b0e776f3-7037-4e01-ad8a-e094888e1681","title":"咖啡树起源与药用价值研究获新证据"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fEhOdWeKiJvg","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}